# Mobile PageSpeed in the 30s–40s

<p align="center">
  <a href="proof/README.md"><img src="media/hero.png" width="600" alt="Mobile score @BEFORE@ to @AFTER@. Main content @BLCP@ seconds to @ALCP@ seconds. Services, menu and answers retained."></a>
